  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">B2B:slagter Ole ApS and Santinos fine Meat and Sausages Limited</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">B2B:slagter Ole ApS and Santinos fine Meat and Sausages Limited for project in environmentally friendly meat processing. The objectives include the following among others:

The other objectives of the project also include but are not restricted to;

&#xbf;	To transfer and implement state-of-the-art Danish agriculture and production technology and know-how to ensure high international standards for animal food.
&#xbf;	To implement highest standards for a safe and healthy working environment for all staff employed.
&#xbf;	To develop a lucrative and profitable business, this would contribute to tax payments in Ghana.
&#xbf;	To develop a modern meat processing business and meat shop that can be used as an example to be followed by others.
&#xbf;	To assist in making an environmentally safe pork production of high quality at one main farm and at 5 ex-contractors.</narrative>
  </description>
